# Architecture

This document describes the system architecture and the four-layer defence middleware that sits at its core.

## System overview

The middleware is positioned between the Flask backend and any OpenAI-compatible LLM API. All sensitive user data passes through the middleware before leaving the application boundary, and all LLM responses pass back through it before reaching the user.

